  "summary": "I always pride myself on being very knowledgeable in whatever field I am currently working in. I will always work with our customers (internal or external) on providing them with effective solutions that meet their requirements. One of my primary considerations is to make sure that the customer understands the technical solution, at least enough to feel comfortable, and that they don't feel like I am being condescending.\n\nThis extends to process solutions as well as technical ones, though obviously technical ones are my forte.\n\nkeywords: ITIL, Service Management, WebSphere, Analytics, Compliance, SCCM, SCCD, Maximo, Reporting Services, BIRT, Eclipse, Nessus, Vulnerability, Penetration Testing, Middleware, IIS, Apache, IHS, Java, J2EE, ServiceNow, HP Service Manager",
