      "description": "After being a developer within the team for some time, I was offered a leadership role to help facilitate development efforts as we move towards a DevOps model. Helping to mentor and train newer developers, and to facilitate cross-team collaboration. This has been an exciting and interesting shift in my responsibilities, and I look forward to the daily challenges associated with the work.\n\nMy team has successfully seen a migration to the latest public version of ServiceNow (Madrid), has on-boarded the HR Module successfully, as well as rolling out a pilot program for 'citizen development'. This allows non-ITSM teams to promote code to sub-production environments, while still maintaining security and stability.",
