   {
    "title": "Support Specialist",
    "locationName": "",
    "timePeriod": {
     "startDate": {
      "month": 11,
      "year": 2001
     },
     "endDate": {
      "month": 11,
      "year": 2004
     }
    },
    "totalDuration": "3 yrs 1 mo",
    "description": "I can only speak with pride about what we did here. Our job was to provide the absolute best call center support in the ISO ATM industry. It was not uncommon for the manufacturer to direct people to us for support on a number of ATM makes. My job was to assist both customer owner/operators of ATMs and the field technicians with full tier support. We did not escalate calls, we were the last stop. If we couldn't fix it, we replaced the machine. Our team was known for first call resolution and the lowest number of field dispatches in the industry. I was consistently one of the top performers in first call resolution and in time to answer. I reliably received excellent reviews from my managers for both my abilities on the phone, and in working with my team to expand and share knowledge.\n\nkeywords: Analytics, Troubleshooting, Customer Service, Support, ATM, Automated Teller, Financial Services",
