      "description": "My current job provides me the benefit of administering a complex and interesting software package. The current offering is referred to as SmartCloud Control Desk, and is targetted to compete with HP's Service Now product and the dominant force in the sector, Remedy. The additional strengths it brings are integration points and a very strong enterprise asset and configuration management system. This has given me extensive exposure to both dba and WebSphere aspects that I had previously had relatively limited experience with. All in all, its been a highly educational experience.",
