      "description": "I provided 3rd Tier specialist support, assisting in driving down rework particularly for field technicians. This role also worked closely with our Research and Development team to devise new solutions to complex problems, such as security solutions to harden our ATM's in at-risk regions. Successful field implementation resulted in substantial loss-reduction for both us and the Armored Carrier. Key projects were related to Encryption and Security Compliance with regards to our deployed ATM fleet, Physicall Access Security on the ATM's themselves, analysis and metrics for our technical teams to communicate the effectiveness of our technical resources up to executive management. Earlier roles were analytics and performance based reporting for our Executive Mangement and Key Accounts (Corporate Accounts) and providing this information to our Executive Management.\n\nkeywords: SOX 404, SDLC, Reporting Services, Analytics, Research and Development, R&D, Support, ATM, Automated Teller Machine, Financial Services",
